        "slc_e2a0158313aba9106d7a983fba89b2b90b2c7f744b73e9abc41984d8a4c80469"
      ],
      "text": "Needle 2 is described as an open 45M-parameter model for tool calling, device use and structured extraction, shipped as a single 14MB binary that runs a session in about 28MB of RAM."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_527cef466feb87996281312d8fba7dd5282bf122bbcd45f59b202a367e63e0c3",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "specifications",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "956840ff176bfe179bb2f230b726f4be44fb11cf",
          "git_sha": "d407c57824b8cf4d96af6c136717995ecd2aae9a",
          "line_end": 5,
          "line_start": 5,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "cactus-compute/needle",
          "url": "https://github.com/cactus-compute/needle/blob/956840ff176bfe179bb2f230b726f4be44fb11cf/README.md#L5-L5"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_e2a0158313aba9106d7a983fba89b2b90b2c7f744b73e9abc41984d8a4c80469"
      ],
      "text": "The model is said to be compressed to CQ2-bit via Cactus Quants and built on the Simple Attention Network findings, baked into its own engine."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_1d420df65fb5faf82007fa72f2259b0162051296301856c51f473b188d73b4ee",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "956840ff176bfe179bb2f230b726f4be44fb11cf",
          "git_sha": "d407c57824b8cf4d96af6c136717995ecd2aae9a",
          "line_end": 7,
          "line_start": 7,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "cactus-compute/needle",
          "url": "https://github.com/cactus-compute/needle/blob/956840ff176bfe179bb2f230b726f4be44fb11cf/README.md#L7-L7"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_abca5874d924a9e74cbe18b4092da5b6e0e265d813fb53e7c1b8cf81ca19d99b"
      ],
      "text": "The repository is the Python package cactus-needle covering inference, LoRA fine-tuning, and export; the inference engine is fetched once from Hugging Face and cached."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_d8073d6887fd543270ac5fc17e391f6154679e4a3bb9390a7be34bc512635444",
