          "line_end": 171,
          "line_start": 171,
          "path": "doc/apis.md",
          "repository": "cactus-compute/needle",
          "url": "https://github.com/cactus-compute/needle/blob/956840ff176bfe179bb2f230b726f4be44fb11cf/doc/apis.md#L171-L171"
        },
        {
          "commit": "956840ff176bfe179bb2f230b726f4be44fb11cf",
          "git_sha": "d407c57824b8cf4d96af6c136717995ecd2aae9a",
          "line_end": 13,
          "line_start": 9,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "cactus-compute/needle",
          "url": "https://github.com/cactus-compute/needle/blob/956840ff176bfe179bb2f230b726f4be44fb11cf/README.md#L9-L13"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_210c9c5476b77edeb071303404ea42bbc168eb8dffbc78259260304204f56f15",
        "slc_a8f4810d0ae7feb0f44dff0493f947c29f4cc19fe6aa96fca513db44575dabab"
      ],
      "text": "Every response carries a calibrated confidence score from a learned head, defined as the minimum of a post-hoc head score and the decoding probability of the call tokens; users set a threshold and escalate below it."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_f170c7f8620d525fa3b69b90323ac4653aa4e10ee719e0d73995ee1b1e7814fe",
