      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_604f67c766af41949871b9cefd3c641d40963a0b4b2a6e4415bb13f6f7e35a27",
        "slc_a8f4810d0ae7feb0f44dff0493f947c29f4cc19fe6aa96fca513db44575dabab"
      ],
      "text": "For catalogues above five tools, a built-in contrastive retrieval head embeds schemas at init and renders only the top five tools per turn, rebuilding the grammar over that subset."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_df2769309b4444b276236564b419700a85cde2a56aa5b21b4954b96582998b69",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "956840ff176bfe179bb2f230b726f4be44fb11cf",
          "git_sha": "d407c57824b8cf4d96af6c136717995ecd2aae9a",
          "line_end": 13,
          "line_start": 9,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "cactus-compute/needle",
          "url": "https://github.com/cactus-compute/needle/blob/956840ff176bfe179bb2f230b726f4be44fb11cf/README.md#L9-L13"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a8f4810d0ae7feb0f44dff0493f947c29f4cc19fe6aa96fca513db44575dabab"
      ],
      "text": "The runtime uses a 256-token sliding window with tools pinned as KV sinks, which the README says keeps total memory near 28MB regardless of conversation length."
    },
