      ],
      "text": "The Python API exposes needle.Needle(tools, system, weights, tool_index_path, buffer_size), agent.run/complete/embed/reset, needle.tool, needle.Field, and needle.extract; tools can be decorated functions, Pydantic models, raw JSON schemas, or a JSON string."
    },
